##Audio Amplifier and Microphone

#Amplifier

- LM386 Chip
- 10uf polarized capacitor
- 220uf polarized capacitor 
- capacitor ceramic (104)
- 10k Potentiometer
- 20ohm resistor 

#Microphone + Speaker

- Piezo Disc (you can play with the size)
- 8ohm Speaker 12V input

